This includes: \par
\b   •  \b0What the program does, \par
\b   •  \b0Whether it is essential or optional, \par
\b   •  \b0Whether it is safe to remove, \par
\b   •  \b0Whether it is known to cause slowdowns or background activity, \par
\b   •  \b0Whether it is associated with OEM bloat, trialware, or unwanted add‑ons. \par
\par
If a program is \b not yet \b0 in the Knowledge Base, it uses AI to generate new Advice automatically.  
